Fixed. Both `npm run test` (4 passing) and `npm run typecheck` (clean) pass.

**The bug:** `src/sim.ts:43` — `if (foodSurplus >= 0)`. A settlement breaking even on food has `foodSurplus === 0`, which the `>= 0` check treated as growth-eligible. Changed to `foodSurplus > 0` so population only grows on a genuine surplus, matching the function's docstring.

A settlement that produces exactly as much food as it consumes now leaves population unchanged.


